{
 "voice": "af_bella",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "fps": 30,
 "sample_rate": 24000,
 "gaps": {
  "sentence": 0.35,
  "scene": 0.8,
  "lead": 0.3,
  "tail": 0.3
 },
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s01_hook",
   "start": 0.3,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Two arrows in, one number out: the dot product.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 0.3,
     "end": 3.925,
     "dur": 3.625,
     "start_frame": 9,
     "end_frame": 118
    },
    {
     "text": "First what it is, then why.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 4.275,
     "end": 6.825,
     "dur": 2.55,
     "start_frame": 128,
     "end_frame": 205
    }
   ],
   "end": 7.625,
   "start_frame": 9,
   "end_frame": 229
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_arrows",
   "start": 7.625,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "A vector, an arrow, has a length and a direction.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 7.625,
     "end": 11.15,
     "dur": 3.525,
     "start_frame": 229,
     "end_frame": 334
    },
    {
     "text": "Arrow a goes five right and one up: five, one.",
     "audio_text": "Arrow [A](/ˈA/) goes five right and one up: five, one.",
     "start": 11.5,
     "end": 15.35,
     "dur": 3.85,
     "start_frame": 345,
     "end_frame": 460
    },
    {
     "text": "Arrow b is one, three; the numbers are components.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 15.7,
     "end": 19.525,
     "dur": 3.825,
     "start_frame": 471,
     "end_frame": 586
    },
    {
     "text": "Pythagoras gives the lengths: about five point one and three point one six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 19.875,
     "end": 25.175,
     "dur": 5.3,
     "start_frame": 596,
     "end_frame": 755
    }
   ],
   "end": 25.975,
   "start_frame": 229,
   "end_frame": 779
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_def_components",
   "start": 25.975,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Definition one: multiply matching parts, then add.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 25.975,
     "end": 30.125,
     "dur": 4.15,
     "start_frame": 779,
     "end_frame": 904
    },
    {
     "text": "The small number under each letter says which part.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 30.475,
     "end": 34.05,
     "dur": 3.575,
     "start_frame": 914,
     "end_frame": 1022
    },
    {
     "text": "The last form writes i twice: a repeated index means add over i equals one, two and three.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 34.4,
     "end": 41.15,
     "dur": 6.75,
     "start_frame": 1032,
     "end_frame": 1235
    }
   ],
   "end": 41.95,
   "start_frame": 779,
   "end_frame": 1258
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_labels",
   "start": 41.95,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "K two point two is equation two point two of Kundu, Cohen and Dowling's Fluid Mechanics, fifth edition.",
     "audio_text": "K two point two is equation two point two of Koondoo, Cohen and Dowling's Fluid Mechanics, fifth edition.",
     "start": 41.95,
     "end": 49.35,
     "dur": 7.4,
     "start_frame": 1258,
     "end_frame": 1480
    },
    {
     "text": "Labels with 0A, the digit zero, are ours: Chapter Zero, Part A of this course.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 49.7,
     "end": 55.8,
     "dur": 6.1,
     "start_frame": 1491,
     "end_frame": 1674
    },
    {
     "text": "Vallis labels point to the main book, and the footnote gives each page.",
     "audio_text": "Valiss labels point to the main book, and the footnote gives each page.",
     "start": 56.15,
     "end": 61.0,
     "dur": 4.85,
     "start_frame": 1685,
     "end_frame": 1830
    }
   ],
   "end": 61.8,
   "start_frame": 1258,
   "end_frame": 1854
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_example",
   "start": 61.8,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Try it: five times one, plus one times three, is eight.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 61.8,
     "end": 66.05,
     "dur": 4.25,
     "start_frame": 1854,
     "end_frame": 1982
    },
    {
     "text": "Eight is a number, not an arrow.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 66.4,
     "end": 69.0,
     "dur": 2.6,
     "start_frame": 1992,
     "end_frame": 2070
    }
   ],
   "end": 69.8,
   "start_frame": 1854,
   "end_frame": 2094
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_def_cosine",
   "start": 69.8,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Definition two: both lengths times the cosine of theta, the angle between them.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 69.8,
     "end": 75.675,
     "dur": 5.875,
     "start_frame": 2094,
     "end_frame": 2270
    },
    {
     "text": "Cosine is one for the same direction, zero at a right angle, minus one for opposite.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 76.025,
     "end": 82.325,
     "dur": 6.3,
     "start_frame": 2281,
     "end_frame": 2470
    },
    {
     "text": "Here it's point four nine six: eight again.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 82.675,
     "end": 85.925,
     "dur": 3.25,
     "start_frame": 2480,
     "end_frame": 2578
    }
   ],
   "end": 86.725,
   "start_frame": 2094,
   "end_frame": 2602
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_same_way",
   "start": 86.725,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the dot product measures how much two arrows point the same way.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 86.725,
     "end": 91.025,
     "dur": 4.3,
     "start_frame": 2602,
     "end_frame": 2731
    },
    {
     "text": "Three, zero with two, zero: six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 91.375,
     "end": 94.35,
     "dur": 2.975,
     "start_frame": 2741,
     "end_frame": 2830
    },
    {
     "text": "At a right angle, zero; backwards, minus six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 94.7,
     "end": 98.35,
     "dur": 3.65,
     "start_frame": 2841,
     "end_frame": 2950
    }
   ],
   "end": 99.15,
   "start_frame": 2602,
   "end_frame": 2974
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_shadow",
   "start": 99.15,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Drop a line from the tip of arrow a onto b's line, at a right angle.",
     "audio_text": "Drop a line from the tip of arrow [A](/ˈA/) onto b's line, at a right angle.",
     "start": 99.15,
     "end": 104.175,
     "dur": 5.025,
     "start_frame": 2974,
     "end_frame": 3125
    },
    {
     "text": "The stretch it marks off is the shadow of arrow a on b.",
     "audio_text": "The stretch it marks off is the shadow of arrow [A](/ˈA/) on b.",
     "start": 104.525,
     "end": 108.6,
     "dur": 4.075,
     "start_frame": 3136,
     "end_frame": 3258
    },
    {
     "text": "In this right-angled triangle, arrow a is the long side.",
     "audio_text": "In this right-angled triangle, arrow [A](/ˈA/) is the long side.",
     "start": 108.95,
     "end": 113.375,
     "dur": 4.425,
     "start_frame": 3268,
     "end_frame": 3401
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow is the side next to theta, so it's the length of arrow a times cos theta.",
     "audio_text": "The shadow is the side next to theta, so it's the length of arrow [A](/ˈA/) times cos theta.",
     "start": 113.725,
     "end": 119.45,
     "dur": 5.725,
     "start_frame": 3412,
     "end_frame": 3583
    },
    {
     "text": "Divide definition two by the length of b: it cancels on the right, leaving the shadow, a dot b over the length of b.",
     "audio_text": "Divide definition two by the length of b: it cancels on the right, leaving the shadow, [A](/ˈA/) dot b over the length of b.",
     "start": 119.8,
     "end": 128.2,
     "dur": 8.4,
     "start_frame": 3594,
     "end_frame": 3846
    },
    {
     "text": "Eight over three point one six two: two point five three.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 128.55,
     "end": 132.675,
     "dur": 4.125,
     "start_frame": 3856,
     "end_frame": 3980
    },
    {
     "text": "And b over its own length, b hat, is b shrunk to length one.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 133.025,
     "end": 137.775,
     "dur": 4.75,
     "start_frame": 3991,
     "end_frame": 4133
    },
    {
     "text": "So the shadow is also a dot b hat.",
     "audio_text": "So the shadow is also [A](/ˈA/) dot b hat.",
     "start": 138.125,
     "end": 141.05,
     "dur": 2.925,
     "start_frame": 4144,
     "end_frame": 4231
    }
   ],
   "end": 141.85,
   "start_frame": 2974,
   "end_frame": 4256
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_question",
   "start": 141.85,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the dot product is the shadow times the length of b.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 141.85,
     "end": 145.825,
     "dur": 3.975,
     "start_frame": 4255,
     "end_frame": 4375
    },
    {
     "text": "Why not just stop at the shadow?",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 146.175,
     "end": 148.475,
     "dur": 2.3,
     "start_frame": 4385,
     "end_frame": 4454
    }
   ],
   "end": 149.275,
   "start_frame": 4256,
   "end_frame": 4478
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_reason1_order",
   "start": 149.275,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason one: order.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 149.275,
     "end": 151.625,
     "dur": 2.35,
     "start_frame": 4478,
     "end_frame": 4549
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow of arrow a on b is two point five three; of b on arrow a, one point five seven.",
     "audio_text": "The shadow of arrow [A](/ˈA/) on b is two point five three; of b on arrow a, one point five seven.",
     "start": 151.975,
     "end": 158.875,
     "dur": 6.9,
     "start_frame": 4559,
     "end_frame": 4766
    },
    {
     "text": "Times the other length, both give eight.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 159.225,
     "end": 161.9,
     "dur": 2.675,
     "start_frame": 4777,
     "end_frame": 4857
    }
   ],
   "end": 162.7,
   "start_frame": 4478,
   "end_frame": 4881
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_reason2_cheap",
   "start": 162.7,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason two: it's cheap: no angle, no square root.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 162.7,
     "end": 166.7,
     "dur": 4.0,
     "start_frame": 4881,
     "end_frame": 5001
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow comes from it by one division.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 167.05,
     "end": 170.025,
     "dur": 2.975,
     "start_frame": 5011,
     "end_frame": 5101
    },
    {
     "text": "If b has length one, a dot b over one is just a dot b: the dot product is the shadow.",
     "audio_text": "If b has length one, [A](/ˈA/) dot b over one is just [A](/ˈA/) dot b: the dot product is the shadow.",
     "start": 170.375,
     "end": 177.1,
     "dur": 6.725,
     "start_frame": 5111,
     "end_frame": 5313
    },
    {
     "text": "So x hat, one unit east, picks out the wind's eastward part.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 177.45,
     "end": 182.175,
     "dur": 4.725,
     "start_frame": 5323,
     "end_frame": 5465
    }
   ],
   "end": 182.975,
   "start_frame": 4881,
   "end_frame": 5489
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_reason3_work",
   "start": 182.975,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason three: physics needs both sizes.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 182.975,
     "end": 186.45,
     "dur": 3.475,
     "start_frame": 5489,
     "end_frame": 5593
    },
    {
     "text": "Pull a sled with twenty newtons, at sixty degrees, for five metres.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 186.8,
     "end": 191.9,
     "dur": 5.1,
     "start_frame": 5604,
     "end_frame": 5757
    },
    {
     "text": "Its shadow, ten newtons, is still a force.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 192.25,
     "end": 195.575,
     "dur": 3.325,
     "start_frame": 5767,
     "end_frame": 5867
    },
    {
     "text": "Times five metres: fifty joules; twice as far, twice the work.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 195.925,
     "end": 200.7,
     "dur": 4.775,
     "start_frame": 5878,
     "end_frame": 6021
    }
   ],
   "end": 201.5,
   "start_frame": 5489,
   "end_frame": 6045
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_vallis17",
   "start": 201.5,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Now the weather.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 201.5,
     "end": 203.15,
     "dur": 1.65,
     "start_frame": 6045,
     "end_frame": 6094
    },
    {
     "text": "This is Vallis one point seven.",
     "audio_text": "This is Valiss one point seven.",
     "start": 203.5,
     "end": 206.25,
     "dur": 2.75,
     "start_frame": 6105,
     "end_frame": 6187
    },
    {
     "text": "Phi is anything the air carries; here, temperature T, and v is the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 206.6,
     "end": 211.975,
     "dur": 5.375,
     "start_frame": 6198,
     "end_frame": 6359
    }
   ],
   "end": 212.775,
   "start_frame": 6045,
   "end_frame": 6383
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_two_thermometers",
   "start": 212.775,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Picture two thermometers.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 212.775,
     "end": 214.975,
     "dur": 2.2,
     "start_frame": 6383,
     "end_frame": 6449
    },
    {
     "text": "One is fixed on a pole: partial T by partial t is how fast its reading changes at that fixed point.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 215.325,
     "end": 222.75,
     "dur": 7.425,
     "start_frame": 6460,
     "end_frame": 6682
    },
    {
     "text": "The other rides a balloon that drifts with the wind, so it always measures the same air parcel: a small volume of air that moves with the flow.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 223.1,
     "end": 232.725,
     "dur": 9.625,
     "start_frame": 6693,
     "end_frame": 6982
    },
    {
     "text": "Its rate of change, D T by D t, is the material derivative: the rate of change following a fluid parcel.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 233.075,
     "end": 240.925,
     "dur": 7.85,
     "start_frame": 6992,
     "end_frame": 7228
    },
    {
     "text": "The two differ because the parcel travels across the temperature map, and that extra change is v dot grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 241.275,
     "end": 248.75,
     "dur": 7.475,
     "start_frame": 7238,
     "end_frame": 7462
    },
    {
     "text": "So the parcel's change equals the change at the fixed point, plus the change from moving across the gradient: advection, transport by the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 249.1,
     "end": 258.625,
     "dur": 9.525,
     "start_frame": 7473,
     "end_frame": 7759
    }
   ],
   "end": 259.425,
   "start_frame": 6383,
   "end_frame": 7783
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_grad_t",
   "start": 259.425,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Grad T is an arrow of two slopes: how fast T changes per metre east, and per metre north.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 259.425,
     "end": 266.15,
     "dur": 6.725,
     "start_frame": 7783,
     "end_frame": 7984
    },
    {
     "text": "It points uphill, towards warmer air; its length is the steepness.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 266.5,
     "end": 271.1,
     "dur": 4.6,
     "start_frame": 7995,
     "end_frame": 8133
    },
    {
     "text": "Here, one degree per hundred kilometres east: ten to the minus five kelvin per metre.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 271.45,
     "end": 277.75,
     "dur": 6.3,
     "start_frame": 8144,
     "end_frame": 8332
    }
   ],
   "end": 278.55,
   "start_frame": 7783,
   "end_frame": 8356
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_calculation",
   "start": 278.55,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The wind is ten metres per second, sixty degrees from grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 278.55,
     "end": 283.425,
     "dur": 4.875,
     "start_frame": 8356,
     "end_frame": 8503
    },
    {
     "text": "Its shadow: five metres per second.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 283.775,
     "end": 286.875,
     "dur": 3.1,
     "start_frame": 8513,
     "end_frame": 8606
    },
    {
     "text": "Times the steepness: five times ten to the minus five kelvin per second, point one eight kelvin per hour.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 287.225,
     "end": 294.475,
     "dur": 7.25,
     "start_frame": 8617,
     "end_frame": 8834
    }
   ],
   "end": 295.275,
   "start_frame": 8356,
   "end_frame": 8858
  },
  {
   "id": "s17_rate_in_time",
   "start": 295.275,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Does the map warm by point one eight an hour?",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 295.275,
     "end": 298.325,
     "dur": 3.05,
     "start_frame": 8858,
     "end_frame": 8950
    },
    {
     "text": "No: one degree per hundred kilometres is the map's slope, a rate in space.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 298.675,
     "end": 304.275,
     "dur": 5.6,
     "start_frame": 8960,
     "end_frame": 9128
    },
    {
     "text": "The parcel heads towards warmth at eighteen kilometres an hour.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 304.625,
     "end": 308.875,
     "dur": 4.25,
     "start_frame": 9139,
     "end_frame": 9266
    },
    {
     "text": "Each hour, it reaches places point one eight degrees warmer.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 309.225,
     "end": 313.6,
     "dur": 4.375,
     "start_frame": 9277,
     "end_frame": 9408
    }
   ],
   "end": 314.4,
   "start_frame": 8858,
   "end_frame": 9432
  },
  {
   "id": "s18_label_zero",
   "start": 314.4,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Suppose each parcel keeps its temperature: no sunshine, no mixing.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 314.4,
     "end": 319.275,
     "dur": 4.875,
     "start_frame": 9432,
     "end_frame": 9578
    },
    {
     "text": "It carries it like a label, so D T by D t is zero.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 319.625,
     "end": 323.825,
     "dur": 4.2,
     "start_frame": 9589,
     "end_frame": 9715
    },
    {
     "text": "Put zero in, then subtract v dot grad T from both sides: partial T by partial t equals minus v dot grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 324.175,
     "end": 333.325,
     "dur": 9.15,
     "start_frame": 9725,
     "end_frame": 10000
    }
   ],
   "end": 334.125,
   "start_frame": 9432,
   "end_frame": 10024
  },
  {
   "id": "s19_pole_cools",
   "start": 334.125,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the pole's thermometer falls point one eight degrees an hour.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 334.125,
     "end": 338.3,
     "dur": 4.175,
     "start_frame": 10024,
     "end_frame": 10149
    },
    {
     "text": "Arriving parcels come from colder places upwind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 338.65,
     "end": 342.55,
     "dur": 3.9,
     "start_frame": 10160,
     "end_frame": 10277
    }
   ],
   "end": 343.35,
   "start_frame": 10024,
   "end_frame": 10300
  },
  {
   "id": "s20_twice_as_steep",
   "start": 343.35,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Make the map twice as steep.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 343.35,
     "end": 345.7,
     "dur": 2.35,
     "start_frame": 10301,
     "end_frame": 10371
    },
    {
     "text": "The wind's shadow stays five metres per second: it belongs to the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 346.05,
     "end": 351.35,
     "dur": 5.3,
     "start_frame": 10382,
     "end_frame": 10541
    },
    {
     "text": "But the pole cools twice as fast, point three six degrees an hour: the dot product holds the steepness; the shadow doesn't.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 351.7,
     "end": 360.175,
     "dur": 8.475,
     "start_frame": 10551,
     "end_frame": 10805
    }
   ],
   "end": 360.975,
   "start_frame": 10300,
   "end_frame": 10829
